 substances and technological tools.">ES-EFP-ESO3-FQX-SB01-003</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="lomloe-criterio-code-badge" data-lomloe-tip="Solve the physical and chemical problems posed using appropriate scientific laws and theories, explaining the procedures used to find solutions and expressing the results appropriately.">ES-EFP-ESO3-FQX-CE01-CR02</span></td><td><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="CCL1 — Expresses and interprets concepts, thoughts, facts and opinions orally, in writing or in sign language">CCL1</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="STEM1 — Uses mathematical concepts and reasoning to interpret and produce information">STEM1</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="STEM2 — Applies scientific reasoning methods to analyse situations and solve problems">STEM2</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="lomloe-criterio-code-badge" data-lomloe-tip="Recognise and describe real scientific problems in the immediate environment and take initiatives in which science, particularly physics and chemistry, can help solve them, critically analysing their impact on society.">ES-EFP-ESO3-FQX-CE01-CR03</span></td><td><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="CCL1 — Expresses and interprets concepts, thoughts, facts and opinions orally, in writing or in sign language">CCL1</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="STEM1 — Uses mathematical concepts and reasoning to interpret and produce information">STEM1</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="STEM2 — Applies scientific reasoning methods to analyse situations and solve problems">STEM2</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="CPSAA4 — Develops collaboration skills by participating actively and responsibly">CPSAA4</span></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2"><strong data-lomloe-tip="ESO · 3rd year of ESO · Physics and Chemistry

Express students’ observations as questions, formulate hypotheses to explain them and demonstrate those hypotheses through scientific experimentation, inquiry and gathering evidence, to develop scientific reasoning and improve skills in scientific methods.">ES-EFP-ESO3-FQX-CE02</strong></td><td><span class="lomloe-criterio-code-badge" data-lomloe-tip="Use scientific methods to identify and describe phenomena based on questions that can be answered through inquiry, deduction, experimental work and logical and mathematical reasoning, distinguishing them from pseudoscientific questions that cannot be tested experimentally.">ES-EFP-ESO3-FQX-CE02-CR01</span></td><td><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="CCL1 — Expresses and interprets concepts, thoughts, facts and opinions orally, in writing or in sign language">CCL1</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="CCL3 — Finds, selects and cross-checks information from different sources, assessing its reliability">CCL3</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="STEM1 — Uses mathematical concepts and reasoning to interpret and produce information">STEM1</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="lomloe-criterio-code-badge" data-lomloe-tip="Select, according to the nature of the questions considered, the best way to test or refute the hypotheses formulated, designing inquiry and evidence-gathering strategies that lead to conclusions and answers suited to the question posed.">ES-EFP-ESO3-FQX-CE02-CR02</span></td><td><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="CCL1 — Expresses and interprets concepts, thoughts, facts and opinions orally, in writing or in sign language">CCL1</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="CCL3 — Finds, selects and cross-checks information from different sources, assessing its reliability">CCL3</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="STEM1 — Uses mathematical concepts and reasoning to interpret and produce information">STEM1</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="STEM2 — Applies scientific reasoning methods to analyse situations and solve problems">STEM2</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="CD1 — Searches the internet and critically cross-checks information">CD1</span><span class="lomloe-cc-badge" data-lomloe-tip="CPSAA4 — Develops collaboration skills by participating actively and responsibly">CPSAA4</span></td></tr></tbody></table>"}
